Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 12:30:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Note each run of Refresh All Apps for Cartouche's setup

The automation of Shortcuts that renews Cartouche every night runs
Refresh All Apps, and iOS lets no app see the player's automations:
Cartouche could not say whether a player had one, nor whether it
worked. Refresh All Apps now notes, in Cartouche's defaults, when it
started, whether LocalDevVPN's tunnel was up once it had waited for it,
and how it ended, with SideStore's words when it failed
(launcher/SideStoreSupport/CartoucheShortcutRun.swift). The setup's
last step, the page of the automation and the System page read it
(CartoucheNightlyRenewal, launcher/Sources/CartoucheRenewalRules.swift).

Renew now and Cartouche's own renewals go through performIntentRefresh
from CartoucheRefresh, never through this action, and note nothing.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MzPJosykrERzJF1rwhVJMA
---
 SideStoreSupport/SideStore.swift | 13 ++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/SideStoreSupport/SideStore.swift b/SideStoreSupport/SideStore.swift
index 0d8b89a..57bbdad 100644
--- a/SideStoreSupport/SideStore.swift
+++ b/SideStoreSupport/SideStore.swift
@@ -60,11 +60,22 @@ public struct RefreshAllAppsIntent: AppIntent, CustomIntentMigratedAppIntent, Pr
     
     public func perform() async throws -> some IntentResult & ProvidesDialog
     {
+        // Cartouche: the setup and the System page say whether the
+        // automation renews Cartouche every night, from each run of this
+        // action (CartoucheShortcutRun).
+        CartoucheShortcutRun.started()
         // Cartouche: LocalDevVPN's Enable action, just before this one in
         // the automation that renews Cartouche every night, returns before
         // its tunnel is up (CartoucheTunnelWait).
         await CartoucheTunnelWait.waitForLocalDevVPN()
-        try await performIntentRefresh(identifier: "RefreshAllIntent", mangledTypeName: "9SideStore20RefreshAllAppsIntentV", intentProgress: progress)
+        CartoucheShortcutRun.tunnel(CartoucheTunnelWait.isConnected)
+        do {
+            try await performIntentRefresh(identifier: "RefreshAllIntent", mangledTypeName: "9SideStore20RefreshAllAppsIntentV", intentProgress: progress)
+        } catch {
+            CartoucheShortcutRun.ended(error)
+            throw error
+        }
+        CartoucheShortcutRun.ended(nil)
         return .result(dialog: "All apps have been refreshed.")
     }
     
